+# Cache eviction policy
+
+No cache eviction policy is currently recorded for this project. A search of
+the project's documentation, design notes, threat model, schema, and source
+crates turned up no adopted decision specifying an eviction strategy (e.g.
+LRU, LFU, TTL) for any cache; the only related material is general research
+literature and third-party example files, neither of which constitutes a
+recorded project decision. If a cache eviction policy is decided in the
+future, it should be recorded here.
